kind: profile
question: which kernels take the Q3_K_M prompt batch's ~38 ms of card time a layer-batch at P = 4096?
term: sum of kernel time inside the prefill window / 220 layer-batches, ms, 1017 Q3_K_M, --place a, A6000
unit: ms
predict: 30..46
